,'de','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Vorlagen legen Aufgaben- und Benachrichtigungstexte bei der Zuweisung von Lernen, Programmen und 360-Bewertungen fest. Leeres Feld = Systemstandard.'),(3206187,'tr','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Şablonlar, öğrenme, program ve 360 değerlendirme atamalarında görev ve bildirim metnini belirler. Boş alan = sistem varsayılanı.'),(3206188,'pl','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Szablony określają tekst zadań i powiadomień przy przypisywaniu szkoleń, programów i ocen 360. Puste pole = tekst systemowy.'),(3206189,'pt','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Os modelos definem o texto de tarefas e notificações ao atribuir formação, programas e avaliações 360. Campo vazio = texto padrão do sistema.'),(3206190,'es','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Las plantillas definen el texto de tareas y notificaciones al asignar aprendizaje, programas y evaluaciones 360. Campo vacío = texto predeterminado del sistema.'),(3206191,'vn','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Mẫu xác định nội dung tác vụ và thông báo khi gán học tập, chương trình và đánh giá 360. Để trống = văn bản mặc định hệ thống.'),(3206192,'zh','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','模板用于在分配学习、项目和 360 评估时设定任务与通知文案。留空则使用系统默认文案。'),(3206193,'ja','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','テンプレートは学習・プログラム・360評価の割り当て時のタスクと通知文を定めます。空欄はシステムの既定文です。'),(3206194,'kz','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Үлгілер оқыту, бағдарлама және 360 бағалауды тағайындағандағы тапсырма мен хабарландыру мәтінін анықтайды. Бос өріс — жүйенің әдепкі мәтіні.'),(3206195,'ar','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','تحدد القوالب نص المهام والإشعارات عند تعيين التعلّم والبرامج وتقييمات 360. الحقل الفارغ = النص الافتراضي للنظام.'),(3206196,'id','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Template menentukan teks tugas dan notifikasi saat menetapkan pembelajaran, program, dan asesmen 360. Kosong = teks default sistem.'),(3206197,'ms','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','Templat menentukan teks tugasan dan pemberitahuan semasa menugaskan pembelajaran, program dan penilaian 360. Kosong = teks lalai sistem.'),(3206198,'th','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_why_x','เทมเพลตกำหนดข้อความงานและการแจ้งเตือนเมื่อมอบหมายการเรียนรู้ โปรแกรม และการประเมิน 360 ช่องว่าง = ข้อความเริ่มต้นของระบบ'),(3206199,'ru','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Как это работает'),(3206200,'en','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','How it works'),(3206201,'ua','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Як це працює'),(3206202,'fr','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Comment ça fonctionne'),(3206203,'it','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Come funziona'),(3206204,'de','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','So funktioniert es'),(3206205,'tr','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Nasıl çalışır'),(3206206,'pl','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Jak to działa'),(3206207,'pt','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Como funciona'),(3206208,'es','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Cómo funciona'),(3206209,'vn','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Cách hoạt động'),(3206210,'zh','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','工作原理'),(3206211,'ja','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','仕組み'),(3206212,'kz','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Қалай жұмыс істейді'),(3206213,'ar','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','كيف يعمل'),(3206214,'id','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Cara kerjanya'),(3206215,'ms','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','Cara ia berfungsi'),(3206216,'th','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_t','วิธีทำงาน'),(3206217,'ru','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_x','Заполните поля заголовка, описания и уведомления. При создании задачи вместо переменных подставятся актуальные данные назначения.'),(3206218,'en','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_x','Fill in the title, description, and notification fields. When a task is created, current assignment data replaces the variables.'),(3206219,'ua','ManageNotifications','mn_crm_g_how_x','Заповніть поля заголо